00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:29.840
So you never like get to truly like feel and enough time with each one of them to be like, oh, I like the feel of driving this one more than that one.

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:30.920
Like that kind of happens.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:40.200
But if you look at like any Forza Horizon game in the last decade or so, it's like the, they're giving you cars so quickly that you're basically just changing into the ones that look cool.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:48.720
Yeah. I've probably spent more time in the, like the, the customization mode in those games than I did in actual races.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:56.440
