00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.760
It's like, wait, that was too easy.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:16.040
So as we, you know, look at another racing game here, you know, I just want to think about just vibe in general here for this game.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:19.820
Did this game set any particular tone?

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:26.480
